# Publish only the application, tests, build scripts and essential repository files.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!/project.yml
!/Grokoo/
!/GrokooTests/
!/ThirdParty/
!/scripts/
!/.github/

# Local development material and generated output stay outside Git history.
**/docs/
**/specs/
**/evidence/
**/prototypes/
**/research/
**/references/
**/incubator/
**/AGENTS.md
**/SKILL.md
**/.DS_Store
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcuserstate
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.xcresult/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
